WEBVTT

01:35.900 --> 01:40.720
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.530 --> 01:44.020
[Episode 28]

02:32.560 --> 02:33.840
Yao, do it.

02:33.930 --> 02:34.720
Kill him.

02:38.840 --> 02:39.560
Do it!

02:40.240 --> 02:41.079
Kill him!

03:43.800 --> 03:44.860
-Wake up.
-Wake up.

03:47.710 --> 03:48.280
Gu Yu.

03:48.870 --> 03:50.070
Where is your prince?

03:51.240 --> 03:52.560
His Majesty has suffered a relapse,

03:52.560 --> 03:54.240
so His Highness has gone to the palace.

03:54.240 --> 03:55.440
He went to the palace?

04:16.600 --> 04:17.800
Dead?

04:21.430 --> 04:22.390
Suige is dead?

04:29.120 --> 04:30.160
Suige is dead...

04:31.120 --> 04:32.150
Suige is dead.

04:32.240 --> 04:32.870
Yao.

04:33.430 --> 04:34.290
Come on, get up.

04:34.360 --> 04:34.890
Suige...

04:34.920 --> 04:35.430
Yao.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.630
Suige is dead.

04:37.650 --> 04:38.790
Look at me!

04:39.870 --> 04:40.480
Look at me.

04:43.710 --> 04:44.510
Father.

04:45.840 --> 04:47.270
I've failed you.

04:48.270 --> 04:49.390
It's my fault.

04:50.159 --> 04:51.820
You shouldn't have helped me.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.159
In this world,

04:54.159 --> 04:55.950
I can turn my back on everything—

04:55.950 --> 04:57.720
everything except you.

05:00.560 --> 05:01.560
I'm not a good son.

05:02.070 --> 05:03.870
I'm the one who dragged you down.

05:04.070 --> 05:05.680
You've been a loyal subject
your entire life,

05:05.680 --> 05:06.630
yet because of me,

05:06.630 --> 05:08.030
you've become a traitor.

05:08.830 --> 05:11.680
It's me. I've pushed you into
this desperate situation.

05:11.680 --> 05:13.800
I've ruined everything for you,

05:13.830 --> 05:14.830
Father!

05:17.430 --> 05:18.510
For you,

05:19.240 --> 05:20.720
I can give up everything.

05:21.870 --> 05:22.560
Traitor

05:22.920 --> 05:23.600
or

05:24.040 --> 05:24.750
rebel—

05:25.800 --> 05:27.720
let them call me whatever they will.

05:27.720 --> 05:29.380
As long as I can save your life,

05:29.920 --> 05:31.520
I'll accept whatever comes,

05:32.430 --> 05:33.490
no matter the cost!

05:34.480 --> 05:35.880
Pull yourself together!

05:36.000 --> 05:38.530
I'll pin the crimes
of patricide and regicide

05:38.720 --> 05:40.310
on Feng Suige,

05:41.310 --> 05:42.270
and you'll be

05:42.830 --> 05:45.360
the hero who killed him.

05:45.720 --> 05:46.780
Do you understand?

05:48.360 --> 05:48.950
Stand up.

05:49.870 --> 05:50.800
Stand up!

05:50.950 --> 05:51.950
Pull yourself together!

05:51.950 --> 05:52.560
Stand up!

05:53.040 --> 05:53.750
Stand up!

05:54.950 --> 05:55.970
Do you know that

05:56.070 --> 05:56.950
right now, if anyone suspects

05:56.950 --> 05:59.070
the true cause of Feng Suige's death,

05:59.310 --> 06:00.360
it will very likely

06:00.360 --> 06:01.950
trigger a mutiny in the Feng Battalion?

06:01.950 --> 06:02.510
So,

06:03.040 --> 06:04.630
you must stay clear-headed.

06:04.630 --> 06:05.360
We must properly

06:05.360 --> 06:07.020
dispose of Feng Suige's body.

06:07.160 --> 06:07.960
Do you hear me?

06:12.680 --> 06:13.270
Alright.

06:13.870 --> 06:15.070
Father, don't worry.

06:16.560 --> 06:18.360
The route out of the palace
has been arranged.

06:18.360 --> 06:19.560
The Imperial Guards on duty along the way

06:19.560 --> 06:20.430
are all my men.

06:20.870 --> 06:22.270
I'll find a secluded spot

06:23.040 --> 06:24.240
and bury Suige there.

06:25.920 --> 06:27.310
Good, good boy.

06:41.200 --> 06:42.730
I have prepared a carriage.

06:42.830 --> 06:43.920
Take Feng Suige's body

06:43.920 --> 06:44.920
out of the palace.

06:45.159 --> 06:45.950
My token will

06:46.159 --> 06:49.420
allow you to pass through every gate
without obstruction.

07:04.120 --> 07:06.360
Marquis Murong, is it done?

07:07.120 --> 07:09.120
Please rest assured, Your Majesty.

07:09.390 --> 07:10.680
I've instructed Yao.

07:12.240 --> 07:13.440
He'll change clothes

07:13.510 --> 07:15.240
as soon as he leaves the palace.

07:15.680 --> 07:17.740
Your Majesty will not be implicated.

07:20.000 --> 07:20.660
Now that...

07:21.830 --> 07:23.720
both father and son are dead,

07:25.390 --> 07:26.790
has Your Majesty decided

07:27.360 --> 07:29.390
how to announce this to the world?

07:32.110 --> 07:34.600
Feng Suige attempted to usurp the throne,

07:35.430 --> 07:37.159
committed regicide, and fled.

07:37.430 --> 07:38.190
And Yao

07:38.510 --> 07:40.370
executed the traitor Feng Suige,

07:40.430 --> 07:41.870
avenging His Majesty.

07:45.310 --> 07:46.690
Years ago, I

07:47.120 --> 07:49.580
helped Feng Pingcheng
ascend to the throne.

07:50.750 --> 07:53.120
I was a founding subject of the dynasty.

07:54.920 --> 07:55.680
Now...

07:57.800 --> 07:59.860
I've cleared the way for Your Majesty

07:59.920 --> 08:02.070
and supported the Second Prince's
ascension to the throne.

08:02.070 --> 08:03.070
This credit

08:03.720 --> 08:05.480
should go to Yao.

08:06.160 --> 08:07.890
Rest assured, Marquis Murong.

08:08.310 --> 08:09.640
When Chengyang ascends the throne,

08:09.640 --> 08:11.370
Yao will be a founding subject.

08:11.720 --> 08:14.600
He will surely rise to
the highest position in the court.

08:14.600 --> 08:15.480
From now on,

08:16.030 --> 08:18.070
our Zhuang family and your Murong family

08:18.070 --> 08:19.400
will be bound together,

08:19.670 --> 08:21.170
sharing weal and woe.

08:29.680 --> 08:31.080
My deepest gratitude...

08:33.390 --> 08:35.320
Your Majesty the Empress Dowager.

08:44.360 --> 08:45.790
Marquis Murong, I'll never forget

08:45.790 --> 08:47.120
your great kindness.

08:49.360 --> 08:50.840
My father's spirit

08:52.240 --> 08:53.700
can finally rest in peace.

09:22.150 --> 09:24.750
Feng Pingcheng's illness
has flared up again?

09:25.840 --> 09:27.240
News came from the palace,

09:27.240 --> 09:29.440
and Feng Suige went to the palace
early this morning.

09:29.440 --> 09:30.870
I don't know what's wrong,

09:30.870 --> 09:31.440
but I can't shake

09:31.440 --> 09:32.790
this uneasy feeling.

09:33.360 --> 09:35.090
You're just worrying too much.

09:36.000 --> 09:37.600
What could possibly happen?

09:37.720 --> 09:38.840
But Feng Pingcheng's health

09:38.840 --> 09:40.240
has been failing for a long time.

09:40.240 --> 09:41.840
It's likely he won't make it.

09:42.080 --> 09:43.200
If Feng Pingcheng

09:43.200 --> 09:44.790
truly doesn't make it this time,

09:44.790 --> 09:46.150
then Suige is just accompanying his father

09:46.150 --> 09:47.350
on his final journey.

09:48.030 --> 09:49.320
But you've come at the right time.

09:49.320 --> 09:50.480
These patients need attention—

09:50.480 --> 09:51.910
some need their bandages changed,

09:51.910 --> 09:53.320
and others need their medicine prepared.

09:53.320 --> 09:54.200
I'm short-handed here,

09:54.200 --> 09:55.200
so stay and help.

09:57.360 --> 09:57.960
All right.

10:32.000 --> 10:32.670
My Lord.

11:12.600 --> 11:13.670
It's Feng Suige.

11:28.750 --> 11:29.670
You always said

11:30.360 --> 11:32.000
a man's duty was to serve his country

11:32.000 --> 11:33.130
on the battlefield.

11:34.510 --> 11:36.600
Even if one day we fall in battle,

11:37.790 --> 11:39.050
we'll have no regrets.

11:41.670 --> 11:42.790
I used to scold you

11:44.120 --> 11:45.720
for speaking of ill omens.

11:48.070 --> 11:49.020
I never thought

11:50.270 --> 11:51.910
I'd be the one burying you.

12:16.700 --> 12:18.070
[Zhengnian Hall]

12:23.400 --> 12:24.290
Miss Yixiao!

12:24.310 --> 12:25.050
Miss Yixiao!

12:25.630 --> 12:26.200
Ruyan?

12:26.790 --> 12:27.550
Why are you here?

12:27.550 --> 12:29.150
S-Something bad has happened.

12:29.150 --> 12:29.960
What happened?

12:29.960 --> 12:31.080
It's Feng Suige.

12:38.420 --> 12:40.440
[Zhengnian Hall]

12:45.570 --> 12:47.020
[Zhengnian Hall]

12:52.130 --> 12:53.360
About five li southeast of here,

12:53.360 --> 12:54.360
there's a forest.

12:54.390 --> 12:55.330
About 100 paces into the woods,

12:55.330 --> 12:57.190
I left a pearl hairpin.

12:57.270 --> 12:59.470
Feng Suige should be somewhere nearby.

14:54.150 --> 14:55.120
That's impossible.

14:55.120 --> 14:55.950
It can't be.

14:56.870 --> 14:57.730
No, it can't be.

15:01.180 --> 15:03.380
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

15:01.830 --> 15:03.110
He'll be fine!

15:04.200 --> 15:07.060
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

15:07.570 --> 15:09.610
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

15:08.320 --> 15:09.630
He'll be fine.

15:10.340 --> 15:13.590
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

15:11.510 --> 15:12.620
He must be fine.

15:14.100 --> 15:16.340
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

15:16.920 --> 15:20.030
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

15:20.520 --> 15:26.350
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

15:26.790 --> 15:28.780
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

15:29.400 --> 15:32.930
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert? ♪

15:33.330 --> 15:35.210
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

15:35.610 --> 15:39.380
♪ Who sighs for me,
enduring separations? ♪

15:39.880 --> 15:41.810
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

15:41.480 --> 15:42.390
Feng Suige.

15:42.380 --> 15:45.230
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

15:45.970 --> 15:50.830
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

15:54.240 --> 15:55.520
Feng Suige!

15:54.930 --> 15:58.240
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

16:01.780 --> 16:04.080
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

16:04.930 --> 16:07.750
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

16:08.460 --> 16:10.730
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

16:11.490 --> 16:13.920
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

16:14.650 --> 16:17.060
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

16:16.320 --> 16:17.180
I'm here.

16:17.360 --> 16:18.490
I'm here to save you.

16:17.790 --> 16:20.270
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

16:19.120 --> 16:20.250
I'm here to save you!

16:21.190 --> 16:23.750
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

16:24.440 --> 16:27.270
♪ As years pass, dust stirs,
stirring deep longing ♪

16:27.960 --> 16:32.860
♪ All I ask is to be together forever ♪

16:51.700 --> 16:53.640
[Closed]

16:56.050 --> 16:57.620
[Zhengnian Hall]

16:59.770 --> 17:01.360
His external wound isn't fatal.

17:01.360 --> 17:03.250
His pupils are dilated,
and his pulse is weak.

17:03.250 --> 17:05.440
He's unconscious
because his airway is obstructed.

17:05.440 --> 17:06.400
Fortunately, his strong willpower

17:06.400 --> 17:07.400
and survival instinct

17:07.400 --> 17:08.920
have kept him barely alive.

17:08.920 --> 17:10.030
And you found him just in time

17:10.030 --> 17:10.829
and saved him,

17:11.000 --> 17:11.750
helping him

17:11.750 --> 17:13.270
cling to life.

17:13.750 --> 17:15.480
However, his heart is failing.

17:15.510 --> 17:17.310
I can't guarantee I can save him.

17:48.270 --> 17:49.640
I've already sent Jie

17:49.640 --> 17:51.040
with the Imperial Guards

17:51.750 --> 17:53.760
to surround Feng Suige's residence

17:53.880 --> 17:55.510
and wipe out his men.

17:56.240 --> 17:57.230
Once

17:57.510 --> 17:58.830
we eliminate all of

17:58.830 --> 18:00.690
Feng Suige's trusted followers,

18:00.720 --> 18:02.850
his Feng Battalion will be leaderless

18:03.830 --> 18:04.550
and won't be able to cause

18:04.550 --> 18:05.750
any trouble anymore.

18:21.960 --> 18:22.680
Yao.

18:24.400 --> 18:26.130
Since things have come to this,

18:27.160 --> 18:28.820
don't dwell on it.

18:29.000 --> 18:29.550
Father,

18:30.720 --> 18:31.550
you must be

18:31.550 --> 18:32.810
very disappointed

18:33.270 --> 18:34.800
to have such a worthless son

18:34.920 --> 18:36.850
who has ruined everything for you.

18:38.270 --> 18:38.960
Yao,

18:39.550 --> 18:40.790
stand up right now.

18:47.880 --> 18:48.550
Yao.

18:51.790 --> 18:52.830
Remember this:

18:53.160 --> 18:54.920
from now on, our Murong family

18:55.720 --> 18:57.680
depends on you.

18:58.750 --> 19:00.680
You must not lose your spirit.

19:06.440 --> 19:07.000
Alright,

19:07.270 --> 19:07.750
Father.

19:26.640 --> 19:27.110
Uncle.

19:28.350 --> 19:30.250
Feng Suige's residence is empty.

19:30.350 --> 19:32.240
His trusted followers are
nowhere to be found.

19:32.240 --> 19:33.240
Our scouts report

19:33.510 --> 19:35.200
that they went to Zhengnian Hall.

19:35.200 --> 19:36.130
Zhengnian Hall?

19:37.240 --> 19:38.920
That's a place for healing the sick.

19:38.920 --> 19:39.550
As far as I know,

19:39.550 --> 19:40.960
Fu Yixiao often goes there.

19:40.960 --> 19:41.440
Yes.

19:41.640 --> 19:42.640
Zhengnian Hall is

19:42.920 --> 19:44.580
located in a busy market area.

19:44.590 --> 19:46.920
I dare not lead troops there recklessly,

19:47.310 --> 19:49.270
fearing the palace coup might be exposed

19:49.270 --> 19:50.500
and ruin your plans.

19:50.830 --> 19:52.690
Please make the decision, Uncle.

19:54.070 --> 19:55.920
The news of Feng Suige's death

19:56.480 --> 19:58.050
hasn't spread yet.

19:58.590 --> 19:59.990
They shouldn't be aware.

20:02.070 --> 20:02.790
Yao,

20:03.350 --> 20:05.600
when you buried his body,

20:05.750 --> 20:08.000
you weren't discovered by anyone,
were you?

20:08.000 --> 20:10.200
I personally led the people to bury him.

20:10.350 --> 20:12.610
There's no way the news could've leaked.

20:13.880 --> 20:15.070
Looks like now...

20:17.070 --> 20:18.930
we can't worry about too much now.

20:19.070 --> 20:19.750
Jie,

20:20.590 --> 20:22.230
take the Imperial Guards

20:22.270 --> 20:23.510
and surround Zhengnian Hall.

20:23.510 --> 20:24.750
No one associated with Feng Suige

20:24.750 --> 20:25.680
shall be spared!

20:25.680 --> 20:26.550
Kill them all!

20:27.070 --> 20:28.070
Yes, Uncle.

20:44.680 --> 20:45.660
How is he?

20:51.480 --> 20:52.800
Please say something.

20:53.000 --> 20:54.330
How is he doing exactly?

20:55.240 --> 20:56.000
Not well.

20:56.680 --> 20:57.830
I've restored his pulse,

20:57.830 --> 20:58.940
so he's still alive.

20:58.940 --> 21:00.420
But I can't say

21:00.880 --> 21:02.210
whether he'll survive.

21:09.000 --> 21:10.000
What should we do?

21:12.590 --> 21:14.270
His yin and yang energies are in chaos,
and his qi and blood flow is blocked—

21:14.270 --> 21:15.730
his life hangs by a thread.

21:18.000 --> 21:18.920
At this point,

21:19.550 --> 21:21.200
I can only take a risky approach:

21:21.200 --> 21:22.880
use potent medicine to stimulate his heart

21:22.880 --> 21:24.110
and buy him a few more days.

21:24.110 --> 21:24.830
But to truly save him,

21:24.830 --> 21:26.890
we must get him to the Storm Alliance!

21:27.240 --> 21:28.170
Storm Alliance?

21:28.830 --> 21:30.270
The place where Ning Fei was saved?

21:30.270 --> 21:31.070
That's right.

21:31.720 --> 21:33.240
There's no time to waste.
Let's depart immediately.

21:33.240 --> 21:34.400
Once we start, there's no turning back.

21:34.400 --> 21:36.260
I'll go prepare the medicine now.

21:38.720 --> 21:40.510
My medicine can only
sustain him for five days.

21:40.510 --> 21:41.160
If we can't get him

21:41.160 --> 21:42.270
to the Storm Alliance within five days

21:42.270 --> 21:43.670
to receive treatment...

21:45.270 --> 21:46.670
it will truly be too late.

21:47.160 --> 21:48.730
Even if it costs me my life,

21:49.350 --> 21:50.680
I'll keep him alive.

21:53.030 --> 21:53.590
Alright.

22:13.480 --> 22:14.510
How is His Highness?

22:14.510 --> 22:15.440
Quick, go prepare a carriage.

22:15.440 --> 22:17.350
I'll explain everything on the way.

22:17.350 --> 22:18.030
Okay.

22:19.440 --> 22:20.000
Let's go.

22:22.590 --> 22:23.200
Thank you.

22:23.880 --> 22:24.740
I'll never forget

22:24.740 --> 22:25.700
this favor.

22:26.270 --> 22:27.200
You're welcome.

22:27.350 --> 22:28.800
You saved my life.

22:29.000 --> 22:30.920
I'm really glad I could help.

22:32.400 --> 22:33.220
From now on,

22:33.310 --> 22:34.720
I'll stay in Yujing City

22:34.790 --> 22:36.590
and find an opportunity
to deal with Murong Yao.

22:36.590 --> 22:37.750
If you need anything,

22:37.750 --> 22:38.680
call on me anytime.

22:38.680 --> 22:39.270
Okay.

22:39.830 --> 22:40.880
Take care of yourself

22:40.880 --> 22:41.740
and be careful.

22:47.000 --> 22:47.640
Mother...

22:49.400 --> 22:51.000
Are you saying my brother...

22:52.270 --> 22:54.070
my brother killed Grandfather,

22:55.110 --> 22:57.280
and he also killed Father?

22:57.440 --> 22:58.030
Yes.

22:59.160 --> 23:00.790
Why would he do that?

23:01.880 --> 23:02.590
Chengyang,

23:03.310 --> 23:04.000
some things

23:04.000 --> 23:06.200
you will understand naturally in time.

23:08.110 --> 23:09.770
After your grandfather died,

23:10.270 --> 23:11.590
your father intended to pass

23:11.590 --> 23:12.590
the throne to you.

23:14.240 --> 23:16.240
But your brother wouldn't allow it.

23:16.720 --> 23:18.180
All because of the throne?

23:19.880 --> 23:21.110
I never even thought

23:21.110 --> 23:23.040
about fighting him for the throne.

23:23.440 --> 23:25.610
Why didn't he just ask me?

23:25.720 --> 23:26.480
Why?

23:27.070 --> 23:28.590
Why would I fight him for it?

23:28.590 --> 23:30.400
I wouldn't fight him for anything!

23:30.400 --> 23:31.640
Because he never truly saw you

23:31.640 --> 23:32.750
as his brother.

23:33.110 --> 23:34.310
You are half-brothers.

23:34.310 --> 23:35.200
In his heart,

23:35.510 --> 23:36.840
his only flesh and blood

23:37.510 --> 23:38.590
was Feng Xiyang.

23:39.000 --> 23:41.000
Naturally, he'd see you as a threat.

23:41.240 --> 23:42.940
I just never expected

23:43.510 --> 23:44.720
he'd be so ruthless

23:44.720 --> 23:45.750
as to kill your father

23:45.750 --> 23:47.440
and usurp the throne.

23:48.110 --> 23:48.770
Chengyang,

23:49.030 --> 23:51.000
you were your father's favorite son

23:51.000 --> 23:52.110
and also the one

23:52.110 --> 23:54.110
your grandfather cared about most.

23:54.240 --> 23:55.920
You must remember their teachings

23:55.920 --> 23:57.270
and become a wise ruler.

23:59.440 --> 24:00.100
Chengyang,

24:00.590 --> 24:02.000
no matter who else falls now,

24:02.000 --> 24:02.930
you cannot fall.

24:03.750 --> 24:04.750
Now it falls to you

24:05.310 --> 24:06.640
to hold Susha together.

24:20.570 --> 24:24.540
[Zhengnian Hall]

24:35.240 --> 24:35.770
General.

24:35.920 --> 24:36.410
Speak.

24:36.790 --> 24:37.960
No one from the Feng household is inside.

24:37.730 --> 24:40.290
[Murong Jie, General of the Jinwu Guard]

24:38.110 --> 24:39.680
We just caught some patients.

24:39.680 --> 24:40.680
They said a group of people

24:40.680 --> 24:42.140
escorted a carriage away.

24:42.350 --> 24:43.420
That must be them.

24:43.510 --> 24:44.640
When did they leave?

24:44.720 --> 24:45.490
Not long ago.

24:46.510 --> 24:47.070
After them!

24:47.070 --> 24:47.590
Yes!

25:27.640 --> 25:28.380
Report!

25:28.440 --> 25:30.320
There are Imperial Guards behind us!

25:30.320 --> 25:32.180
Looks like they're coming for us!

25:33.070 --> 25:34.130
Qiongqi Unit,

25:34.270 --> 25:35.440
follow me back!

25:35.460 --> 25:36.250
I'll help!

25:36.400 --> 25:37.600
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

25:40.070 --> 25:40.640
Lu Ke!

25:40.690 --> 25:41.420
Hurry!

25:51.680 --> 25:52.680
Stop them!

26:06.880 --> 26:08.010
There are pursuers!

26:11.200 --> 26:11.860
This is bad.

26:12.110 --> 26:13.000
There are too many pursuers.

26:13.000 --> 26:13.920
Gu Yu and Hound

26:13.920 --> 26:15.380
can't hold them off at all!

26:15.510 --> 26:16.310
Guys,

26:16.400 --> 26:17.350
follow me back to cover the retreat!

26:17.350 --> 26:18.350
-Yes, sir!
-Lu Ke!

26:18.640 --> 26:20.240
Protect His Highness and go!

26:21.590 --> 26:22.160
Let's go!

27:02.270 --> 27:03.120
Move aside!

27:06.400 --> 27:07.240
Hound!

27:25.680 --> 27:26.660
Don't waste time on them!

27:26.660 --> 27:27.860
Follow me in pursuit!

27:30.510 --> 27:32.510
Murong Jie!

28:55.240 --> 28:56.800
Honor heaven above,

28:57.200 --> 28:58.750
respect the earth below!

28:59.000 --> 29:00.750
Be loyal to the ruler and the kingdom,

29:00.750 --> 29:02.210
and never fail the people!

29:12.480 --> 29:13.200
Stop...

29:15.160 --> 29:15.960
Stop...

29:26.070 --> 29:28.880
Your Highness...

29:41.720 --> 29:42.640
Hound!

29:44.000 --> 29:45.510
Gu Yu!

29:54.920 --> 29:55.350
Brother!

29:55.350 --> 29:56.720
Kill them all!

29:56.790 --> 29:58.720
-Kill them!
-Kill them!

29:59.200 --> 29:59.750
Brother!

30:00.440 --> 30:01.240
Leave me be.

30:05.880 --> 30:06.480
Brother.

30:19.200 --> 30:19.800
General,

30:20.070 --> 30:21.440
we couldn't catch up to that carriage.

30:21.440 --> 30:22.270
We lost them.

31:27.720 --> 31:28.530
I know you're worried

31:28.530 --> 31:30.330
about your father's condition.

31:30.590 --> 31:32.650
If you really want to return to Susha,

31:32.830 --> 31:33.830
I can help you.

31:34.830 --> 31:36.270
When I was taken away

31:36.270 --> 31:36.790
like a criminal,

31:36.790 --> 31:37.830
you did nothing.

31:38.920 --> 31:41.050
Now you come saying you want to help me?

31:42.000 --> 31:43.400
I'll find a way to make Xia Jingyan

31:43.400 --> 31:44.290
let you go back.

31:45.400 --> 31:46.000
Even if...

31:47.310 --> 31:49.040
I have to bow my head and beg him.

31:50.350 --> 31:51.880
For my sake, you're willing

31:52.070 --> 31:53.640
to put aside your pride

31:53.680 --> 31:55.280
and beg your greatest enemy.

31:55.720 --> 31:56.480
Should I be

31:56.480 --> 31:58.140
eternally grateful for that?

31:59.110 --> 32:00.350
I know you resent me,

32:00.960 --> 32:02.030
but we both know

32:02.750 --> 32:03.680
that on your own,

32:03.750 --> 32:05.150
you cannot leave Jinxiu.

32:07.790 --> 32:08.270
No.

32:09.790 --> 32:10.850
I don't resent you.

32:11.440 --> 32:13.590
You can only resent someone
you care about.

32:13.590 --> 32:14.350
I no longer feel

32:14.350 --> 32:15.350
anything for you.

32:15.440 --> 32:16.840
So how could I resent you?

32:18.160 --> 32:19.360
If that's the case...

32:21.550 --> 32:23.280
then I'll return your freedom.

32:29.470 --> 32:31.410
[Letter of Divorce]

32:36.440 --> 32:37.750
All this talk about letting me go

32:37.750 --> 32:39.150
or returning my freedom—

32:39.680 --> 32:41.340
you think I don't understand?

32:41.440 --> 32:42.160
You're just trying

32:42.160 --> 32:43.110
to use this chance

32:43.110 --> 32:43.680
to pay me back

32:43.680 --> 32:45.110
for helping you escape Susha.

32:45.110 --> 32:46.720
So you can feel better about yourself,

32:46.720 --> 32:48.320
thinking you owe me nothing.

32:49.030 --> 32:50.200
How can there be a person as hypocritical

32:50.200 --> 32:51.480
and heartless as you?

32:54.000 --> 32:54.880
Now that things have come to this,

32:54.880 --> 32:56.880
what's the point of saying all this?

32:57.550 --> 32:58.240
You and I

32:59.590 --> 33:00.920
were never meant to be.

33:02.550 --> 33:03.680
"Never meant to be"?

33:04.200 --> 33:05.400
When you were trapped in Susha,

33:05.400 --> 33:06.730
why didn't you say that?

33:07.110 --> 33:08.240
When you had nowhere to turn,

33:08.240 --> 33:09.570
why didn't you say that?

33:10.000 --> 33:11.270
Now that I'm no longer useful to you,

33:11.270 --> 33:13.070
you say we were never meant to be?

33:14.640 --> 33:15.480
Xia Jingshi,

33:16.110 --> 33:17.550
you disgust me.

33:21.110 --> 33:22.370
I don't need your help.

33:24.110 --> 33:25.960
Stop this pretense.

33:27.350 --> 33:28.830
Xia Jingshi, hear this:

33:29.590 --> 33:31.880
you're merely
a useless prince consort of Susha.

33:31.880 --> 33:32.590
What right do you have

33:32.590 --> 33:34.480
to cast me aside with a letter of divorce?

33:34.480 --> 33:36.940
It is I, Feng Xiyang,
who will cast you aside!

33:37.110 --> 33:38.070
From today on,

33:38.750 --> 33:40.810
we have nothing to do with each other.

33:41.000 --> 33:42.530
Our bond as husband and wife

33:43.590 --> 33:45.120
is severed once and for all!

33:55.110 --> 33:56.710
Then, Princess, as you wish.

33:57.790 --> 34:00.240
From this moment on,
we have no connection whatsoever.

34:00.240 --> 34:01.640
From now on, whatever I do

34:01.920 --> 34:03.250
is none of your concern.

34:05.200 --> 34:06.200
Princess Xiyang,

34:06.590 --> 34:07.310
farewell.

34:12.440 --> 34:13.110
Stop.

34:15.510 --> 34:16.710
I know you hold a grudge

34:16.710 --> 34:17.840
against my brother.

34:19.070 --> 34:20.670
I don't care what else you do.

34:22.150 --> 34:23.210
But remember this:

34:23.590 --> 34:25.250
if you dare to harm my brother,

34:25.960 --> 34:27.690
I'll kill you with my own hands.

34:43.760 --> 34:44.690
What did you say?

34:45.280 --> 34:46.440
The body's gone?

34:47.000 --> 34:47.480
Yes.

34:47.800 --> 34:49.230
I was worried, so I went to check myself.

34:49.230 --> 34:50.830
The body has been taken away.

34:51.880 --> 34:52.530
Father,

34:52.800 --> 34:53.730
could Feng Suige

34:53.800 --> 34:54.670
still be alive?

34:58.960 --> 34:59.480
Jie,

35:00.150 --> 35:00.880
how did it go?

35:01.590 --> 35:02.230
Jie...

35:04.320 --> 35:04.910
Uncle,

35:05.670 --> 35:07.440
please forgive my incompetence.

35:07.440 --> 35:08.610
I failed to kill all of Feng Suige's

35:08.610 --> 35:09.500
subordinates.

35:10.030 --> 35:11.280
They fought desperately

35:11.280 --> 35:12.940
and escorted a carriage away.

35:13.510 --> 35:14.350
A carriage?

35:15.840 --> 35:17.100
Where did they flee to?

35:17.590 --> 35:18.720
To the Susha border.

35:19.070 --> 35:20.400
However, there are
many intersections there.

35:20.400 --> 35:21.440
Based on the wheel tracks alone,

35:21.440 --> 35:22.000
we can't tell

35:22.000 --> 35:23.130
which way they fled.

35:23.440 --> 35:24.440
However, I've already

35:24.440 --> 35:26.360
sent men to pursue them
along different routes.

35:26.360 --> 35:27.070
Well done.

35:27.920 --> 35:28.690
Jie,

35:29.280 --> 35:30.280
you should go back

35:30.320 --> 35:31.110
and rest now.

35:41.030 --> 35:41.920
Feng Suige

35:42.480 --> 35:44.440
has to be in that carriage.

35:45.800 --> 35:46.670
But if

35:46.670 --> 35:48.110
it were just his corpse,

35:48.880 --> 35:49.800
there'd be no need for them

35:49.800 --> 35:51.930
to fight so desperately to protect it.

35:52.550 --> 35:53.380
Could...

35:54.800 --> 35:56.600
Feng Suige truly still be alive?

35:57.510 --> 35:59.400
Whether he lives or dies,

36:00.190 --> 36:01.710
his defeat is sealed.

36:01.800 --> 36:03.230
Even if he still draws breath,

36:03.230 --> 36:05.110
he must be severely injured.

36:06.190 --> 36:07.280
Before long,

36:07.710 --> 36:09.510
Feng Chengyang will ascend the throne.

36:09.510 --> 36:10.360
By then,

36:10.510 --> 36:11.710
it will be a done deal.

36:12.510 --> 36:13.280
In this game,

36:14.280 --> 36:16.280
Feng Suige has already lost.

36:16.590 --> 36:17.110
Father,

36:17.960 --> 36:19.030
I was incompetent.

36:19.360 --> 36:21.290
If Feng Suige truly is still alive,

36:22.110 --> 36:23.880
I'll kill him with my own hands!

36:25.150 --> 36:25.880
Yao.

36:26.880 --> 36:27.850
No matter what,

36:27.960 --> 36:29.290
you must remember this:

36:29.320 --> 36:30.700
publicly, we must claim

36:31.070 --> 36:32.960
that Feng Suige is dead

36:32.980 --> 36:33.670
and that you

36:33.670 --> 36:35.360
personally executed him.

36:35.400 --> 36:36.070
This way,

36:36.110 --> 36:37.960
when Feng Chengyang ascends the throne,

36:37.960 --> 36:40.020
you'll receive the greatest credit.

36:40.840 --> 36:41.840
By then,

36:41.920 --> 36:43.320
once we control the situation,

36:43.320 --> 36:45.490
even if there are unexpected changes,

36:46.030 --> 36:47.830
they won't be cause for concern.

36:47.880 --> 36:49.140
I understand, Father.

36:49.550 --> 36:50.230
Alright.

36:51.590 --> 36:53.520
You should go back and rest as well.

37:00.070 --> 37:01.230
Let me think about

37:01.880 --> 37:03.810
how to inform the Empress Dowager.

37:16.550 --> 37:17.350
Your Majesty,

37:17.670 --> 37:19.030
over the past few days,
the Prince of Zhennan

37:19.030 --> 37:20.360
has either remained in Rongyang Palace

37:20.360 --> 37:21.550
or wandered around the grounds.

37:21.550 --> 37:22.590
He hasn't done anything suspicious.

37:22.590 --> 37:23.510
Over these past few days, I

37:23.510 --> 37:25.510
deliberately removed the guards
from Rongyang Palace,

37:25.510 --> 37:27.400
hoping he would reveal
his true intentions.

37:27.400 --> 37:29.030
But he's made no move at all.

37:30.510 --> 37:31.840
Why do you think that is?

37:33.360 --> 37:34.360
This servant is too foolish

37:34.360 --> 37:35.560
to fathom the reason.

37:36.840 --> 37:37.920
Tell me...

37:39.480 --> 37:40.600
could Xia Jingshi

37:40.630 --> 37:41.710
have planted moles

37:41.710 --> 37:43.150
around me?

37:48.550 --> 37:49.350
Your Majesty,

37:49.510 --> 37:50.710
shall I investigate?

37:57.510 --> 37:58.630
Everyone around me

37:58.630 --> 38:00.230
has been thoroughly vetted.

38:00.630 --> 38:01.630
Xia Jingshi's reach

38:01.630 --> 38:02.890
can't extend that far.

38:03.710 --> 38:04.870
Is it possible

38:04.960 --> 38:05.960
that Xia Jingshi has guessed

38:05.960 --> 38:07.150
Your Majesty's intentions?

38:07.150 --> 38:08.150
That is possible.

38:08.840 --> 38:10.070
But what if he has?

38:10.760 --> 38:12.420
I'll kill him sooner or later.

38:15.510 --> 38:16.230
Your Majesty,

38:16.230 --> 38:17.560
urgent news from Susha!

38:27.880 --> 38:30.410
Susha's Prime Minister Zhuang Shen
has died.

38:30.590 --> 38:32.550
The First Prince Feng Suige...

38:34.360 --> 38:36.620
committed regicide to usurp the throne?

38:37.000 --> 38:38.330
Feng Pingcheng is dead.

38:39.190 --> 38:40.590
Feng Suige was executed?

38:44.400 --> 38:45.200
Your Majesty.

38:45.590 --> 38:46.510
It's destiny.

38:48.590 --> 38:50.260
I truly am blessed by heaven.

38:56.360 --> 38:57.000
I was just thinking about

38:57.000 --> 38:58.660
how to eliminate Xia Jingshi.

39:00.000 --> 39:02.330
And heaven has given me this opportunity.

39:09.440 --> 39:11.360
The Empress Dowager has arrived!

39:14.710 --> 39:15.710
All of you, leave.

39:19.670 --> 39:20.380
Mother.

39:20.720 --> 39:21.920
Mother, you've heard, haven't you?

39:21.920 --> 39:23.590
Feng Pingcheng and Feng Suige
are both dead.

39:23.590 --> 39:25.050
What a pleasant surprise!

39:25.230 --> 39:26.420
The one who will
succeed to the throne in Susha

39:26.420 --> 39:28.920
can only be the Second Prince,
Feng Chengyang.

39:28.920 --> 39:30.760
A young ruler will bring
uncertainty to the nation.

39:30.760 --> 39:32.710
Prime Minister Zhuang is also dead.

39:32.710 --> 39:34.880
Susha's court will surely be in chaos.

39:35.760 --> 39:36.820
In that case,

39:36.920 --> 39:39.110
Susha will be too preoccupied
with its own affairs.

39:39.110 --> 39:40.630
Perhaps for the next 10 or even 20 years,

39:40.630 --> 39:41.190
they won't dare

39:41.190 --> 39:42.760
wage war against our Jinxiu again.

39:42.760 --> 39:43.620
Right, Mother?

39:43.960 --> 39:45.320
What are you trying to say?

39:45.320 --> 39:45.880
Then...

39:46.840 --> 39:47.900
Then does that mean

39:47.960 --> 39:48.480
we no longer need to

39:48.480 --> 39:49.230
keep Xia Jingshi alive?

39:49.230 --> 39:50.110
I'm warning you,

39:50.110 --> 39:51.150
don't act rashly.

39:52.510 --> 39:53.550
Why?

39:54.190 --> 39:55.280
You said it yourself!

39:55.280 --> 39:56.000
You said we needed to spare his life

39:56.000 --> 39:57.000
to make use of him!

39:57.030 --> 39:58.190
He's of no use now,

39:58.230 --> 39:59.490
so why can't I kill him?

39:59.510 --> 40:00.670
Why can't I kill him?

40:00.840 --> 40:02.360
Whether Xia Jingshi has value

40:02.360 --> 40:03.590
is not determined by Susha.

40:03.590 --> 40:04.840
It's determined by you!

40:04.840 --> 40:06.300
As the ruler of a nation,

40:06.590 --> 40:08.070
how can you be so foolish?

40:10.030 --> 40:10.800
In the end,

40:12.110 --> 40:13.840
you just can't bear to kill him.

40:14.190 --> 40:15.670
Don't treat court politics

40:15.670 --> 40:16.630
as child's play!

40:17.110 --> 40:18.570
Xia Jingshi's value isn't

40:18.590 --> 40:20.440
just in helping us against Susha.

40:20.440 --> 40:21.670
The Zhennan Army under his command

40:21.670 --> 40:23.110
is his greatest value!

40:24.320 --> 40:25.470
Without my order,

40:25.550 --> 40:26.880
do not move against him.

40:27.000 --> 40:28.060
Do you understand?

40:32.960 --> 40:36.300
[Edict of Condemnation]

40:36.030 --> 40:37.480
The criminal Feng Suige

40:37.880 --> 40:39.070
committed patricide and regicide.

40:39.070 --> 40:40.230
Such heinous crimes against all order

40:40.230 --> 40:41.840
are condemned by both gods and men!

40:41.840 --> 40:43.250
Now, struck by heaven's wrath,

40:43.250 --> 40:44.450
he has been executed,

40:44.590 --> 40:46.440
his body left to rot in the wilderness!

40:46.440 --> 40:47.470
By imperial decree:

40:47.470 --> 40:48.800
strip him of all titles,

40:49.280 --> 40:52.940
and remove his name from
the imperial family records as a traitor!

40:53.070 --> 40:55.690
All his family assets
shall be confiscated.

40:55.810 --> 40:58.480
His household servants shall be exiled
for military service,

40:58.480 --> 41:00.010
with no pardon for 30 years!

41:07.990 --> 41:08.930
Lord Ling,

41:09.230 --> 41:11.190
where on earth are you taking us?

41:11.320 --> 41:11.960
We've been walking for ages

41:11.960 --> 41:12.920
and haven't seen a soul.

41:12.920 --> 41:13.440
Can the Storm Alliance

41:13.440 --> 41:15.070
really be in these mountains?

41:15.070 --> 41:16.480
Carry him properly
and stop talking nonsense.

41:16.480 --> 41:17.920
Remember, once we enter the alliance,

41:17.920 --> 41:18.960
don't mention the Feng family—

41:18.960 --> 41:20.320
especially not the First Prince!

41:20.320 --> 41:21.030
Why?

41:21.800 --> 41:22.400
Lord Ling,

41:22.710 --> 41:24.070
what exactly is the Storm Alliance?

41:24.070 --> 41:25.730
What kind of people are there?

41:25.880 --> 41:26.440
They're all

41:26.440 --> 41:28.240
refugees and wounded soldiers.

41:28.280 --> 41:29.110
Speaking of which—

41:29.110 --> 41:30.130
before we enter the alliance,

41:30.130 --> 41:31.480
let me give you a warning.

41:31.480 --> 41:33.550
The alliance recognizes
no national boundaries.

41:33.550 --> 41:35.440
It has only four branches: Fishing,
Woodcutting, Farming, and Studying.

41:35.440 --> 41:36.900
Each branch has an elder.

41:36.960 --> 41:37.760
Any matter

41:38.360 --> 41:39.190
is decided

41:39.190 --> 41:40.400
by discussion among the four elders.

41:40.400 --> 41:42.020
So watch what you say,

41:42.110 --> 41:43.550
or they might decide to get rid of us.

41:43.550 --> 41:44.390
Y-Y-You're

41:44.590 --> 41:45.920
making it sound so creepy.

41:45.920 --> 41:46.800
Why does this alliance

41:46.800 --> 41:48.480
make me so uneasy?

41:48.550 --> 41:49.840
-Can we really go there?
-Let me tell you something

41:49.840 --> 41:51.100
even more unsettling.

41:51.230 --> 41:52.960
If you can't remember
what I just told you,

41:52.960 --> 41:54.110
the person you're carrying

41:54.110 --> 41:55.230
may die at any moment.

41:55.230 --> 41:55.710
Go!

41:56.150 --> 41:56.800
I'll remember that!
